{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團ILLIT，日前剛推出迷你專輯《BREAK EVEN》並公開新歌《You 're Under Arrest》MV，獲靚仔男神宋江驚喜亮相，成為話題。</p><p>宋江退伍後積極拍戲，主演韓劇《四手聯彈，兩首奏鳴曲》外，近日更驚喜客串ILLIT的新歌MV。4位成員化身「黑衣特務」，四處奔走尋找神秘男子。歌曲結尾時，宋江摘下頭套露出真面目，被網民笑言犯下「太靚仔」的罪名。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:47.769840+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:03:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:10.772828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:21.287144+00:00","content_hash":"4f6e3363c4dc1a3cb7fe81c7f33fb34672a367d6b9d8b7209399f9c439898220","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:47.769840+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}